ok   set_value stores and reads a scalar
ok   add_list_value builds a list, absent key returns empty array
ok   child! creates and returns a nested Params, nested() never stores
ok   key? is true for scalars, lists and nested params
ok   inspect lists scalars, then lists, then nested, each in insertion order (Params has no keys)
ok   set_path assembles nested params from a Query.split_key-shaped path
ok   a name can only be one kind at a time: last write wins, like Rack
ok   to_h returns only scalars, empty? and inspect are deterministic
ok   set_upload stores a file; upload is nil when absent, upload? says which
ok   the nullable upload return works in an if, the way a controller uses it
ok   an empty file still counts as sent
ok   a file evicts a String, a list and a nested Params of the same name
ok   set_value, add_list_value and child! evict a file of the same name
ok   uploads are inspected after scalars, lists and nested Params
ok   int reads a bounded decimal and never raises
ok   parse_int accepts an optional minus and at most 18 digits
ok   page_number is 1-based and clamped to Params.max_page
17 tests, 98 assertions, 0 failures
